<tbody><tr class="t-nv"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/continue" title="cpp/language/continue"><tt>continue</tt></a></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/goto" title="cpp/language/goto"><tt>goto</tt></a></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv-h2"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/statements#Assertion_statements" title="cpp/language/statements">Assertion statements</a></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/contract_assert" title="cpp/language/contract assert"><tt>contract_assert</tt></a> <span class="t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26">(C++26)</span></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv-h2"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/statements#Declaration_statements" title="cpp/language/statements">Declaration statements</a></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/declarations" title="cpp/language/declarations"><span class="t-spar">declaration</span>&#160;; </a></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv-h2"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/statements#Try_blocks" title="cpp/language/statements">Try blocks</a></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/try" title="cpp/language/try"><code style="white-space: pre;" class="mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-cpp mw-content-ltr" dir="ltr"><span class="k">try</span></code> block</a></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv-h2"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/transactional_memory" title="cpp/language/transactional memory">Transactional memory</a></td></tr>
<tr class="t-nv"><td colspan="5"><a href="/cpp/language/transactional_memory#Synchronized_blocks" title="cpp/language/transactional memory"><code>synchronized</code></a> etc <span class="t-mark-rev t-since-tm-ts t-mark-ts">(TM TS)</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
</div><div><span class="editsection noprint plainlinks" title="Edit this template"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://cppreference.com/index.php?title=Template:cpp/language/statements/navbar_content&amp;action=edit">&#91;edit&#93;</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class="t-navbar-sep">&#160;</div></div>
<p>Conditionally executes a statement repeatedly, where the statement does not need to manage the loop condition.
</p>
<div id="toc" class="toc" role="navigation" aria-labelledby="mw-toc-heading"><input type="checkbox" role="button" id="toctogglecheckbox" class="toctogglecheckbox" style="display:none" /><div class="toctitle" lang="en" dir="ltr"><h2 id="mw-toc-heading">Contents</h2><span class="toctogglespan"><label class="toctogglelabel" for="toctogglecheckbox"></label></span></div>
